    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Adjustable frequency to help lift surface buildup and tough stains<br\/><br\/>✔ Long-lasting battery – up to 200 uses per full charge<br\/><br\/>✔ Travel-ready design – portable, durable, and easy to carry<br\/><br\/>✔ Advanced vibration technology – up to 12,000 pulses per minute<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner is very easy and simple to use.<br\/><br\/>1. Wash the tip of your Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner<br\/><br\/>2. Turn on your device<br\/><br\/>3. Place the vibrating tip on (and around) your visible buildup and surface stains<br\/><br\/>4. Rinse your mouth with warm water<br\/><br\/>Recommended: Repeat 4x a week (up to 2 minutes a session)<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner consists of:<\/p><p>1x Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner<\/p><p>1x Micro USB Cable<\/p><p>1x Manual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Don't overuse the tooth cleaner, we recommend 4x times a week, 2 minutes per session.<br\/><br\/>✘ Not safe for Children under the age of 12.<br\/><br\/>✔ Only buy certified Tooth Cleaners.<br\/><br\/>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using an Ultra Sonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Neglecting your oral care routine can be devastating on teeth and gums. Over time, surface stains and buildup may accumulate, affecting the overall cleanliness and appearance of your teeth. Maintaining a consistent routine helps keep your mouth feeling smooth, refreshed, and cared for.<br\/><br\/>This product may also be reffered to as one of the following:<br\/><br\/>Calculus remover, Dental irrigator, Dental scaler, Oral irrigator, Plaque remover, Tartar removal tool, Tartar remover, Tooth cleaner, Tooth stain remover, Ultrasonic dental cleaner, Ultrasonic scaler, Ultrasonic tooth cleaner.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
